# Safety net: this checkout IS ~/.config/arcmac (user-emacs-directory),
# so runtime artifacts must never land in the repo. All litter paths are
# redirected to ~/.local/state/arcmac in config.org's state section; this
# catches anything a stale session or a new package still drops here.
eln-cache/
auto-save-list/
transient/
eshell/
history
places.eld
recentf.eld
bookmarks.eld
projects.eld
tramp
custom.el
*.eld

